  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to  increase the access, reliability and affordability of water supply in the Greater Beirut and Mount Lebanon (GBML) Region through the construction of multipurpose Bisri Dam, Water Treatment Plant, Conveyance Pipeline System, Hydropower Plant and Wastewater NW System and allied infrastructure.</narrative>
